        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For the acquisition of crude oil within close proximity of the Refineries, we operate a fleet of trucks and have contracts with third-party trucking fleets to acquire and deliver crude oil to our pipeline systems or directly to the Refineries primarily for consumption.",
